      <div class="page-hdr"><a href="#" onclick="nav('property-intel')" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);text-decoration:none;">← Back to Property Intelligence</a><h2 style="margin-top:6px;">Property Evaluation — BUY</h2><p>Evaluate a ready-built property before purchase.</p></div>
      <div class="alert-bar alert-info">📋 This is for someone considering buying an existing house. BuildMe helps identify what to check — it does not replace professional inspections.</div>
      <div class="grid g2" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="metric-l">Property</div><div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;">Green Valley Residence</div><p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:2px;">Independent House · Coimbatore · 2,200 sqft</p></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="metric-l">Asking Price</div><div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;">₹65,00,000</div><p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:2px;">Rate: ₹2,955/sqft <span class="badge b-demo" style="margin-left:4px;">DEMO DATA</span></p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid g3" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="metric-l">Condition Score</div><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--amber);">42/100</div><p style="font-size:10px;color:var(--amber);">Moderate Visible Concern</p></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="metric-l">Photos Uploaded</div><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;">14</div><p style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);">Across 6 categories</p></div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-body"><div class="metric-l">Checklist</div><div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;">70%</div><p style="font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);">14/20 items completed</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:12px;"><div class="card-hdr"><h3 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;">Attention Items</h3></div><div class="card-body">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.15);border-radius:6px;background:var(--red-bg);"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--red);">🔴 HIGH</span><span style="font-size:12px;">Possible dampness detected — bathroom area</span><span class="trust trust-ai">AI-ASSISTED</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(217,119,6,.15);border-radius:6px;background:var(--amber-bg);"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--amber);">🟡 MEDIUM</span><span style="font-size:12px;">Visible wall crack — exterior north wall</span><span class="trust trust-ai">AI-ASSISTED</span></div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;"><span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--amber);">🟡 MEDIUM</span><span style="font-size:12px;">Roof inspection not completed</span></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-hdr"><h3 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600;">Due-Diligence Checklist</h3></div><div class="card-body">
        <div class="grid g2">
          <div><h4 style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;">Structural</h4>
            <div style="font-size:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;"><div>✅ Visible cracks checked</div><div>✅ Walls inspected</div><div>⬜ Columns/beams visually inspected</div><div>⬜ Roof inspected</div></div></div>
          <div><h4 style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;">Water / Damp</h4>
            <div style="font-size:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;"><div>✅ Dampness checked</div><div>⬜ Leakage checked</div><div>⬜ Bathroom waterproofing checked</div><div>⬜ Terrace checked</div></div></div>
          <div><h4 style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;">Documents</h4>
            <div style="font-size:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;"><div>✅ Ownership documents reviewed</div><div>✅ Approval documents reviewed</div><div>⬜ Property tax documents</div><div>⬜ Relevant certificates</div></div></div>
          <div><h4 style="font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;">Utilities</h4>
            <div style="font-size:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;"><div>✅ Electrical panel checked</div><div>✅ Water supply checked</div><div>⬜ Drainage checked</div><div>⬜ Plumbing leakage checked</div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
